## What it is

The rulebook for every БОГMODE video. It covers colours, typography, wordmark use, safe zones, captions, motion, colour grade, audio and export settings.

## Why

It is written to be machine-readable, so editing tools (including AI) can produce on-brand cuts without me redefining the look each time.

